  "account": "文汇书香苑",
  "source_title": "朱光亚 那个骑破自行车的老头走了，邻居看了讣告才知道：他替 14 亿人挡了一辈子核弹\n#朱光亚#国之脊梁#读书感悟 #文字共鸣 #情感共鸣 #读书心得",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 398.416667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二零一一年二月二十六号，北京下着大雪，一个八十七岁的老头走了，没有热搜，没有头条，没有全网哀悼。单位门口的布告栏上就贴了一张白纸黑字的布告，安安静静跟什么都没发生似的。邻居路过扫了一眼，当场就傻了。这个每天骑个破自行车买菜排队，见谁都笑呵呵。呵科的老头竟然是两弹一星。二十三昧元勋里最后一个被解密的人，他叫朱光亚。今天我就给你讲讲这个老头的一生有多狠，有多让人心疼。时间倒回一九四五年那一年，朱光亚二十一岁被当时的政府派去美国学造原子弹。物理学家吴大由带着朱光亚李政道，还有几个教授兴冲冲就去了，结果呢踏上美国土地。第一天，当头一棒美国人说，核设施基地中国人连门口都不许站，不是针对谁？是一九四六年。美国刚出台了原子能法，核技术列成了最高机密，谁都不让碰。英国二战时跟美国合伙搞曼哈顿计划，战后照样被拒之门外。但你想想，一个二十一岁的中国年轻人大老远跑来学造原子弹，结果连大门都进不去，这叫什么？这不是拒绝，这是把一个民族的尊严暗在泥里踩。朱光亚没吵没闹，把这口气咽进了骨头里。他转身进了密歇根大学，一头扎进实验室。别人喝咖啡谈恋爱，他在啃和物理。三年整整三年，他拿下了核物理博士学位，门门功克全a连拿了四年奖学金。导师后来说了一句话，批改朱光亚的论文，不像在评判学生更像在见证一颗原子弹的诞生。这话狂不狂，但人家有狂的资本。一九四九年，朱光亚博士毕业了，这时候，他面前摆着两条路一条路，留在美国高薪洋房实验室，前途一片光明。他的同学李政道就是选了这条路，后来跟杨振宁一起拿了诺贝尔奖，另一条路回中国。那时候的中国刚打完仗，百废待兴，别说原子弹了，圆珠笔都造不出来，回去能干啥。朱光亚选了第二条，不光自己回，他还干了一件震动美国学界的大事。一九五零年春天，二十六岁的朱光亚把自己关在宿舍里写了整整一夜。第二天，一封给留美同学的一封公开信塞进了全美各高校中国留学生的信箱。信里有一封段话，今天读起来还让人热血上头。回去吧，祖国在向我们召唤，我们都是在中国长大的，不曾种过一粒米，不曾挖过一块煤。我们都是靠千千万万中日劳动的，中国工农大众的血汗供养长大，让我们回去把血汗洒在祖国的土地上。这封信带着十几个惊叹号，像一颗炸弹，在留美学生里炸开了五十二个人签的名。五十二把实验室的钥匙扔进了太平洋五十二个。美国做梦都想留住的大脑，在同一艘船上掉头向东李征。到后来开玩笑说，当年派去美国的人礼，只有朱光雅是派对的派，我算是派错了，因为朱光亚真回去了，回到了新中国。一九五零年二月，朱光亚拒绝了美国的救济舰登上了回国的船，他心里只有一个念头，中国人必须有自己的原子弹。但他没想到，回国之后，真正的苦日子才刚开始。一九五二年，抗美援朝打的正凶。嗯，朱光雅被派去板门店当停战谈判的英文翻译。临走前，他跟妻子许慧君说，我去东北打老虎，到了谈判桌上。他每天面对的是什么？是美方代表手里挥舞着核大棒，扬言要对中国进行核打击。人家手里有核弹，说话腰杆就硬。朱光亚坐在那里一字一句翻译的那些威胁的话，心里在滴血。他算是彻底明白了没有原子弹，你在谈判桌上连大声说话的资格都没有。回国之后，朱光亚提笔写了一本原子能和原子武器，不只是给别人看，也是在提醒自己，这个年轻的共和国，绝对不能没有原子弹。一九五五年，中国终于启动了原子能工业。一开始有苏联老大哥帮忙，朱光亚心里还踏实点，可谁又能想到，一九五九年中苏的关系说崩就崩？苏联人拍拍屁股走了，主纸带走了，专家也撤走了，还丢下一句话，没有我们，你们中国二十年也搞不出原子弹，就是在这一年，三十五岁的朱光亚像人间蒸发一样消失了。他去了哪儿，他干了什么，他的妻子不知道，邻居不知道，连他的孩子都不知道，只知道这个家的男人突然就没了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 1950,
      "text": "二零一一年二月二十六号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2450,
      "end_ms": 3870,
      "text": "北京下着大雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4690,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "一个八十七岁的老头走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8010,
      "end_ms": 8950,
      "text": "没有热搜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9550,
      "end_ms": 10570,
      "text": "没有头条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11010,
      "end_ms": 12670,
      "text": "没有全网哀悼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12930,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "单位门口的布告栏上就贴了一张白纸黑字的布告，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18170,
      "end_ms": 21050,
      "text": "安安静静跟什么都没发生似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21270,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "邻居路过扫了一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23450,
      "end_ms": 24510,
      "text": "当场就傻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24790,
      "end_ms": 27890,
      "text": "这个每天骑个破自行车买菜排队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27890,
      "end_ms": 29870,
      "text": "见谁都笑呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29870,
      "end_ms": 32980,
      "text": "呵科的老头竟然是两弹一星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33100,
      "end_ms": 36980,
      "text": "二十三昧元勋里最后一个被解密的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37060,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "他叫朱光亚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39160,
      "end_ms": 44740,
      "text": "今天我就给你讲讲这个老头的一生有多狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 45820,
      "end_ms": 47320,
      "text": "有多让人心疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48380,
      "end_ms": 53930,
      "text": "时间倒回一九四五年那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55270,
      "end_ms": 60815,
      "text": "朱光亚二十一岁被当时的政府派去美国学造原子弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 61730,
      "end_ms": 65240,
      "text": "物理学家吴大由带着朱光亚李政道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 65440,
      "end_ms": 67965,
      "text": "还有几个教授兴冲冲就去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 68790,
      "end_ms": 70890,
      "text": "结果呢踏上美国土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 70890,
      "end_ms": 71375,
      "text": "第一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 71890,
      "end_ms": 75120,
      "text": "当头一棒美国人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 75420,
      "end_ms": 79565,
      "text": "核设施基地中国人连门口都不许站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 80620,
      "end_ms": 81660,
      "text": "不是针对谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 81820,
      "end_ms": 83060,
      "text": "是一九四六年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 83120,
      "end_ms": 85825,
      "text": "美国刚出台了原子能法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86300,
      "end_ms": 88625,
      "text": "核技术列成了最高机密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89340,
      "end_ms": 90335,
      "text": "谁都不让碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 90690,
      "end_ms": 94310,
      "text": "英国二战时跟美国合伙搞曼哈顿计划，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 94530,
      "end_ms": 97135,
      "text": "战后照样被拒之门外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 97580,
      "end_ms": 98405,
      "text": "但你想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 98810,
      "end_ms": 103685,
      "text": "一个二十一岁的中国年轻人大老远跑来学造原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 104120,
      "end_ms": 106075,
      "text": "结果连大门都进不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106380,
      "end_ms": 107075,
      "text": "这叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107320,
      "end_ms": 108315,
      "text": "这不是拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108760,
      "end_ms": 112525,
      "text": "这是把一个民族的尊严暗在泥里踩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 113540,
      "end_ms": 115385,
      "text": "朱光亚没吵没闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116290,
      "end_ms": 118990,
      "text": "把这口气咽进了骨头里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 119050,
      "end_ms": 121075,
      "text": "他转身进了密歇根大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 121500,
      "end_ms": 123185,
      "text": "一头扎进实验室。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123630,
      "end_ms": 125315,
      "text": "别人喝咖啡谈恋爱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 125630,
      "end_ms": 126685,
      "text": "他在啃和物理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127580,
      "end_ms": 129345,
      "text": "三年整整三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129980,
      "end_ms": 132155,
      "text": "他拿下了核物理博士学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132620,
      "end_ms": 136505,
      "text": "门门功克全a连拿了四年奖学金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 137090,
      "end_ms": 138655,
      "text": "导师后来说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 139170,
      "end_ms": 140695,
      "text": "批改朱光亚的论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 141200,
      "end_ms": 145655,
      "text": "不像在评判学生更像在见证一颗原子弹的诞生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 146430,
      "end_ms": 147515,
      "text": "这话狂不狂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 148010,
      "end_ms": 149685,
      "text": "但人家有狂的资本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 150390,
      "end_ms": 151645,
      "text": "一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152000,
      "end_ms": 153595,
      "text": "朱光亚博士毕业了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 154070,
      "end_ms": 154610,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 154610,
      "end_ms": 156910,
      "text": "他面前摆着两条路一条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 157130,
      "end_ms": 161150,
      "text": "留在美国高薪洋房实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 161450,
      "end_ms": 163085,
      "text": "前途一片光明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 163980,
      "end_ms": 167655,
      "text": "他的同学李政道就是选了这条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 168710,
      "end_ms": 171515,
      "text": "后来跟杨振宁一起拿了诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 172080,
      "end_ms": 174185,
      "text": "另一条路回中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 174940,
      "end_ms": 177025,
      "text": "那时候的中国刚打完仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 177330,
      "end_ms": 178230,
      "text": "百废待兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 178510,
      "end_ms": 179625,
      "text": "别说原子弹了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 179890,
      "end_ms": 181230,
      "text": "圆珠笔都造不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 181490,
      "end_ms": 182550,
      "text": "回去能干啥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184450,
      "end_ms": 185970,
      "text": "朱光亚选了第二条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186470,
      "end_ms": 187470,
      "text": "不光自己回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 187930,
      "end_ms": 190990,
      "text": "他还干了一件震动美国学界的大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191710,
      "end_ms": 193150,
      "text": "一九五零年春天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 193550,
      "end_ms": 197930,
      "text": "二十六岁的朱光亚把自己关在宿舍里写了整整一夜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 199370,
      "end_ms": 199970,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200910,
      "end_ms": 208110,
      "text": "一封给留美同学的一封公开信塞进了全美各高校中国留学生的信箱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 209130,
      "end_ms": 210240,
      "text": "信里有一封段话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211220,
      "end_ms": 213700,
      "text": "今天读起来还让人热血上头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 214320,
      "end_ms": 214900,
      "text": "回去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 216620,
      "end_ms": 218140,
      "text": "祖国在向我们召唤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 219080,
      "end_ms": 220880,
      "text": "我们都是在中国长大的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221720,
      "end_ms": 223220,
      "text": "不曾种过一粒米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 223400,
      "end_ms": 224780,
      "text": "不曾挖过一块煤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 225260,
      "end_ms": 228480,
      "text": "我们都是靠千千万万中日劳动的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 228620,
      "end_ms": 231720,
      "text": "中国工农大众的血汗供养长大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 232440,
      "end_ms": 236800,
      "text": "让我们回去把血汗洒在祖国的土地上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 236840,
      "end_ms": 239460,
      "text": "这封信带着十几个惊叹号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 240030,
      "end_ms": 241245,
      "text": "像一颗炸弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 241930,
      "end_ms": 245654,
      "text": "在留美学生里炸开了五十二个人签的名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 246610,
      "end_ms": 251090,
      "text": "五十二把实验室的钥匙扔进了太平洋五十二个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 251090,
      "end_ms": 253305,
      "text": "美国做梦都想留住的大脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 253630,
      "end_ms": 257760,
      "text": "在同一艘船上掉头向东李征。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 257760,
      "end_ms": 259065,
      "text": "到后来开玩笑说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 259950,
      "end_ms": 261795,
      "text": "当年派去美国的人礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00092",
      "start_ms": 262120,
      "end_ms": 264550,
      "text": "只有朱光雅是派对的派，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00093",
      "start_ms": 264550,
      "end_ms": 265925,
      "text": "我算是派错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00094",
      "start_ms": 266380,
      "end_ms": 268085,
      "text": "因为朱光亚真回去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00095",
      "start_ms": 268440,
      "end_ms": 269785,
      "text": "回到了新中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00096",
      "start_ms": 270570,
      "end_ms": 271990,
      "text": "一九五零年二月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00097",
      "start_ms": 272290,
      "end_ms": 276655,
      "text": "朱光亚拒绝了美国的救济舰登上了回国的船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277620,
      "end_ms": 279455,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00099",
      "start_ms": 280220,
      "end_ms": 283485,
      "text": "中国人必须有自己的原子弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00100",
      "start_ms": 284460,
      "end_ms": 285615,
      "text": "但他没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286340,
      "end_ms": 287495,
      "text": "回国之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00102",
      "start_ms": 288220,
      "end_ms": 291385,
      "text": "真正的苦日子才刚开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291880,
      "end_ms": 292800,
      "text": "一九五二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00104",
      "start_ms": 292980,
      "end_ms": 294525,
      "text": "抗美援朝打的正凶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00105",
      "start_ms": 294710,
      "end_ms": 294945,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00106",
      "start_ms": 295190,
      "end_ms": 300385,
      "text": "朱光雅被派去板门店当停战谈判的英文翻译。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00107",
      "start_ms": 301120,
      "end_ms": 301820,
      "text": "临走前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00108",
      "start_ms": 302140,
      "end_ms": 303975,
      "text": "他跟妻子许慧君说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00109",
      "start_ms": 305100,
      "end_ms": 306465,
      "text": "我去东北打老虎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306930,
      "end_ms": 307975,
      "text": "到了谈判桌上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00111",
      "start_ms": 308310,
      "end_ms": 310350,
      "text": "他每天面对的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00112",
      "start_ms": 310670,
      "end_ms": 313590,
      "text": "是美方代表手里挥舞着核大棒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00113",
      "start_ms": 314050,
      "end_ms": 317110,
      "text": "扬言要对中国进行核打击。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317330,
      "end_ms": 318730,
      "text": "人家手里有核弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00115",
      "start_ms": 319070,
      "end_ms": 320290,
      "text": "说话腰杆就硬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00116",
      "start_ms": 320770,
      "end_ms": 324890,
      "text": "朱光亚坐在那里一字一句翻译的那些威胁的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00117",
      "start_ms": 325230,
      "end_ms": 326210,
      "text": "心里在滴血。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00118",
      "start_ms": 326690,
      "end_ms": 329630,
      "text": "他算是彻底明白了没有原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330130,
      "end_ms": 333450,
      "text": "你在谈判桌上连大声说话的资格都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00120",
      "start_ms": 334350,
      "end_ms": 335190,
      "text": "回国之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00121",
      "start_ms": 335350,
      "end_ms": 339520,
      "text": "朱光亚提笔写了一本原子能和原子武器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00122",
      "start_ms": 340320,
      "end_ms": 341740,
      "text": "不只是给别人看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00123",
      "start_ms": 342360,
      "end_ms": 344200,
      "text": "也是在提醒自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00124",
      "start_ms": 344800,
      "end_ms": 346420,
      "text": "这个年轻的共和国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00125",
      "start_ms": 346800,
      "end_ms": 348740,
      "text": "绝对不能没有原子弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00126",
      "start_ms": 349740,
      "end_ms": 350780,
      "text": "一九五五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00127",
      "start_ms": 351160,
      "end_ms": 354259,
      "text": "中国终于启动了原子能工业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00128",
      "start_ms": 354419,
      "end_ms": 356880,
      "text": "一开始有苏联老大哥帮忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00129",
      "start_ms": 357140,
      "end_ms": 359040,
      "text": "朱光亚心里还踏实点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00130",
      "start_ms": 359900,
      "end_ms": 361180,
      "text": "可谁又能想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00131",
      "start_ms": 361460,
      "end_ms": 365020,
      "text": "一九五九年中苏的关系说崩就崩？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00132",
      "start_ms": 365580,
      "end_ms": 367715,
      "text": "苏联人拍拍屁股走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00133",
      "start_ms": 368120,
      "end_ms": 369205,
      "text": "主纸带走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369640,
      "end_ms": 370920,
      "text": "专家也撤走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00135",
      "start_ms": 370960,
      "end_ms": 372195,
      "text": "还丢下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00136",
      "start_ms": 372830,
      "end_ms": 373615,
      "text": "没有我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00137",
      "start_ms": 374500,
      "end_ms": 377645,
      "text": "你们中国二十年也搞不出原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00138",
      "start_ms": 378540,
      "end_ms": 379795,
      "text": "就是在这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00139",
      "start_ms": 380350,
      "end_ms": 385305,
      "text": "三十五岁的朱光亚像人间蒸发一样消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00140",
      "start_ms": 386160,
      "end_ms": 386925,
      "text": "他去了哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00141",
      "start_ms": 387770,
      "end_ms": 388715,
      "text": "他干了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00142",
      "start_ms": 389700,
      "end_ms": 391160,
      "text": "他的妻子不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00143",
      "start_ms": 391220,
      "end_ms": 392280,
      "text": "邻居不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00144",
      "start_ms": 392520,
      "end_ms": 394265,
      "text": "连他的孩子都不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b3dccdafdb88d8a8_s00145",
      "start_ms": 394670,
      "end_ms": 398390,
      "text": "只知道这个家的男人突然就没了。"
    }
  ],
